    "end": 15.833333333333334,
    "event": "d01-afternoon-reporter"
  },
  {
    "actor": "Larry",
    "type": "spoken",
    "text": "Taking the charge. Alma's got a girl in Pittsburgh and the place is going dark. You guys shoot the ballroom tonight, I'll be back.",
